==Description==

<div class="mw-translate-fuzzy">
La commande [[Image:Silk_Point_onCurve.svg|32px]] La commande '''Silk Point sur courbe''' crée un point, un objet Point_onCurve, sur une courbe [[Silk_CubicCurve_4/fr|CubicCurve_4]] ou [[Silk_CubicCurve_6/fr|CubicCurve_6]] (fonctionne également sur certaines courbes hors de Silk).
</div>

[[File:3.-Point_onCurve.png|300px]]

{{Caption|Marqueurs Point_onCurve placés le long de deux courbes, illustrant le paramètre u}}

<div lang="en" dir="ltr" class="mw-content-ltr">
These points are used to define start and end points of [[Silk_Workbench#Curve_Segments|curve segments]] on a [[Silk_Workbench#Primary_Curves|primary curve]]. To be easily recognizable, the direction of a curve is indicated by differently colored start and end points.
</div>

[[Image:Silk_Workflow-54.png|100px]] [[Image:Button_right.svg|12px|link=]] 
